<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11496] Long running SQL queries could be randomly canceled from WC</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11496</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve tried to run some long-running queries from WC(more than a couple of minutes) and I&apos;ve faced a behavior when the query was canceled without clicking on the cancel button.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve opened different browser tabs at this moment, maybe it could be the reason.&lt;/p&gt;
